tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>Cosmetic Cloak: A cloak celebrating the 20th Anniversary of DDO!</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>Introduced with the celebration of the <a href=\"/page/20th_Anniversary\" title=\"20th Anniversary\">20th Anniversary</a> (February 2026). Once you acquire a cloak by speaking with Weaver, you can pick up additional cloaks for your account by interacting with <a href=\"/page/Weaver-in-Training\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weaver-in-Training\">Weaver-in-Training</a>, Apprentice of Cloaks on the lower floor of the Hall of Heroes.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817185108\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.129 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3116/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19132/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4979/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 15/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n118.91%  136.928     36 Template:IO\n100.00%  115.152      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  115.152      1 -total\n 95.34%  109.789  